{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261114/photo/bkn-20261114140544972-1114_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261114145214\"/><p>長洲東灣海灘懷疑有人墮海。</p><p>長洲有人懷疑墮海。今午(14日)1時44分，一名女子報案，指與胞妹失去聯絡，擔心其發生事故墮進海中，救援人員接報後趕至東灣海灘一帶展開海陸搜索，惜暫未發現事主蹤影。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T07:01:13.028591+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":104,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T06:05:44+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T07:14:54.574270+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T06:54:40.028113+00:00","content_hash":"31c1214f95ab8c059d30882dd2bdaabdb5c33099374f762e64c5a0167179682d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}